{"id":"n40052-1-9","stage":4,"title":"기말 · 期末","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40052-1-9-1","ko":"기말만 지나면 방학이네.","zh":"期末一过就放假了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기말만","meaning":"期末","explanation":"기말：期末；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"기말","audio":"/audio/e3af9768303ea4582b53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40052","senseId":"1","lemma":"기말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지나면","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방학이네.","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e3af9768303ea458","term":"기말","zh":"期末","audio":"/audio/e3af9768303ea4582b53.mp3","entryId":"40052","definition":"一定期间或一个学期的末尾。","pronunciation":["기말"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]}],"audio":"/audio/1522c6614c4bb2990d08.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40052-1-9-2","ko":"이렇게 또 한 학기가 끝이 나는구나.","zh":"又这样，一个学期又要结束了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학기가","meaning":"学期","explanation":"학기：学期；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"학기","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72420","senseId":"1","lemma":"학기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝이","meaning":"完，到头，最后","explanation":"끝：完，到头，最后；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"끝","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48072","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는구나.","meaning":"表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。","explanation":"나다：表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62134","senseId":"2","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"a95c145d8eb8427e","term":"학기","zh":"学期","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3","entryId":"72420","definition":"按照学业要求将一个学年划分成的时间段。","pronunciation":["학끼"]},{"id":"fa22cdfb3221d82b","term":"끝","zh":"完，到头，最后","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3","entryId":"48072","definition":"事情或顺序的最终。","pronunciation":["끋"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"6